    },
    {
      "id": "ea4a0a62b7ad1523",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 326,
      "quote": "v CONNECTED",
      "source": "tls/s2n_tls13_key_schedule.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "appendix-A.2",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "d2f97c01a0ca0112",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 37,
      "quote": "If a given secret is not available, then the 0-value consisting of a string of Hash.length bytes set to zeros is used.",
      "source": "tls/s2n_tls13_secrets.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "section-7.1",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "4f57f2f6261451f1",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 49,
      "quote": "Note that in some cases a zero- length Context (indicated by \"\") is passed to HKDF-Expand-Label",
      "source": "tls/s2n_tls13_secrets.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "section-7.1",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "fc4ccae35477ba81",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 142,
      "quote": "Derive-Secret(Secret, Label, Messages) = HKDF-Expand-Label(Secret, Label, Transcript-Hash(Messages), Hash.length)",
      "source": "tls/s2n_tls13_secrets.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "section-7.1",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3b889b1f08552b3",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 193,
      "quote": "The key used to compute the Finished message is computed from the Base Key defined in Section 4.4 using HKDF (see Section 7.1). Specifically: finished_key = HKDF-Expand-Label(BaseKey, \"finished\", \"\", Hash.length)",
      "source": "tls/s2n_tls13_secrets.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "section-4.4.4",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "495c77602a92af1b",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 254,
      "quote": "0 | v PSK ->  HKDF-Extract = Early Secret",
      "source": "tls/s2n_tls13_secrets.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "section-7.1",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "0f389a89823d6a46",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 260,
      "quote": "There are multiple potential Early Secret values, depending on which PSK the server ultimately selects.  The client will need to compute one for each potential PSK",
      "source": "tls/s2n_tls13_secrets.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "section-7.1",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "753cf32d49977733",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 298,
      "quote": "if no PSK is selected, it will then need to compute the Early Secret corresponding to the zero PSK.",
      "source": "tls/s2n_tls13_secrets.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "section-7.1",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "e29cc2922473abae",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 321,
      "quote": "| +-----> Derive-Secret(., \"ext binder\" | \"res binder\", \"\") |                     = binder_key",
      "source": "tls/s2n_tls13_secrets.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "section-7.1",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "93a5289e573792cc",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 345,
      "quote": "| +-----> Derive-Secret(., \"c e traffic\", ClientHello) |                     = client_early_traffic_secret",
      "source": "tls/s2n_tls13_secrets.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "section-7.1",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "fc9fce382e2345aa",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 361,
      "quote": "| v Derive-Secret(., \"derived\", \"\") | v (EC)DHE -> HKDF-Extract = Handshake Secret",
      "source": "tls/s2n_tls13_secrets.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "section-7.1",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "974ce4c22651532e",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 390,
      "quote": "| +-----> Derive-Secret(., \"c hs traffic\", |                     ClientHello...ServerHello) |                     = client_handshake_traffic_secret",
      "source": "tls/s2n_tls13_secrets.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "section-7.1",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "998c4f3f86b8ee9c",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 411,
      "quote": "The key used to compute the Finished message is computed from the Base Key defined in Section 4.4 using HKDF (see Section 7.1).",
      "source": "tls/s2n_tls13_secrets.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "section-4.4.4",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "1841ac4a9821e8fe",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 422,
      "quote": "| +-----> Derive-Secret(., \"s hs traffic\", |                     ClientHello...ServerHello) |                     = server_handshake_traffic_secret",
      "source": "tls/s2n_tls13_secrets.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "section-7.1",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "5521b07b2cb639bd",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 443,
      "quote": "The key used to compute the Finished message is computed from the Base Key defined in Section 4.4 using HKDF (see Section 7.1).",
      "source": "tls/s2n_tls13_secrets.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "section-4.4.4",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "331fcc52ce96286d",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 454,
      "quote": "v Derive-Secret(., \"derived\", \"\") | v 0 -> HKDF-Extract = Master Secret",
      "source": "tls/s2n_tls13_secrets.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "section-7.1",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5b8d1a3c38fb3bb",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 478,
      "quote": "| +-----> Derive-Secret(., \"c ap traffic\", |                     ClientHello...server Finished) |                     = client_application_traffic_secret_0",
      "source": "tls/s2n_tls13_secrets.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "section-7.1",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "061d4b19da3f1560",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 495,
      "quote": "| +-----> Derive-Secret(., \"s ap traffic\", |                     ClientHello...server Finished) |                     = server_application_traffic_secret_0",
      "source": "tls/s2n_tls13_secrets.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "section-7.1",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "95f911781f6bed6e",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 512,
      "quote": "| +-----> Derive-Secret(., \"res master\", ClientHello...client Finished) = resumption_master_secret",
      "source": "tls/s2n_tls13_secrets.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "section-7.1",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "2adc766643c8d9ca",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 534,
      "quote": "| +-----> Derive-Secret(., \"exp master\", |                     ClientHello...server Finished) |                     = exporter_master_secret",
      "source": "tls/s2n_tls13_secrets.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "section-7.1",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "105544709b4fb5b9",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 717,
      "quote": "The exporter value is computed as: TLS-Exporter(label, context_value, key_length) = HKDF-Expand-Label(Derive-Secret(Secret, label, \"\"), \"exporter\", Hash(context_value), key_length)",
      "source": "tls/s2n_tls13_secrets.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "section-7.5",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "993408dded447ba9",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 122,
      "quote": "enum { quic_transport_parameters(0x39), (65535) } ExtensionType;",
      "source": "tls/s2n_tls_parameters.h",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9001",
      "target_section": "8.2",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "73e6c98112c6cd08",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 354,
      "quote": "As noted, a client MUST NOT seek a match for a reference identifier of CN-ID if the presented identifiers include a DNS-ID, SRV-ID, URI-ID, or any application-specific identifier types supported by the client.",
      "source": "tls/s2n_x509_validator.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6125",
      "target_section": "section-6.4.4",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "610d63c6644b0e30",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 365,
      "quote": "Therefore, if and only if the presented identifiers do not include a DNS-ID, SRV-ID, URI-ID, or any application-specific identifier types supported by the client, then the client MAY as a last resort check for a string whose form matches that of a fully qualified DNS domain name in a Common Name field of the subject field (i.e., a CN-ID).",
      "source": "tls/s2n_x509_validator.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6125",
      "target_section": "section-6.4.4",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "comment": "not implemented due to lack of utility",
      "id": "975bff6b7e54c80e",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 425,
      "quote": "If the client provided a \"signature_algorithms\" extension, then all certificates provided by the server MUST be signed by a hash/signature algorithm pair that appears in that extension.",
      "source": "tls/s2n_x509_validator.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5246",
      "target_section": "section-7.4.2",
      "type": "EXCEPTION"
    },
    {
      "comment": "not implemented due to lack of utility",
      "id": "9ecd3cbc0fd28b91",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 432,
      "quote": "If no \"signature_algorithms_cert\" extension is present, then the \"signature_algorithms\" extension also applies to signatures appearing in certificates.",
      "source": "tls/s2n_x509_validator.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "section-4.2.3",
      "type": "EXCEPTION"
    },
    {
      "id": "4405939a02ed8f3e",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 783,
      "quote": "If an extension applies to the entire chain, it SHOULD be included in the first CertificateEntry.",
      "source": "tls/s2n_x509_validator.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446",
      "target_section": "section-4.4.2",
      "type": "CITATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "5103bb2625151773",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 884,
      "quote": "thisUpdate      The most recent time at which the status being indicated is known by the responder to have been correct. nextUpdate      The time at or before which newer information will be available about the status of the certificate.",
      "source": "tls/s2n_x509_validator.c",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6960",
      "target_section": "section-2.4",
      "type": "CITATION"
    }
  ],
