            "      F.2. Protecting Application Data ...............................94",
            "      F.3. Explicit IVs ..............................................95",
            "      F.4. Security of Composite Cipher Modes ........................95",
            "      F.5. Denial of Service .........................................96",
            "      F.6. Final Notes ...............................................96",
