          "id": "section-4",
          "lines": [
            "   This handshake resumes from the handshake in Section 3.  Since the",
            "   server provided a session ticket that permitted 0-RTT, and the client",
            "   is configured for 0-RTT, the client is able to send 0-RTT data.",
            "",
